WEBVTT

1
00:00:15,537 --> 00:00:17,669
[musik mengancam]

2
00:00:17,713 --> 00:00:20,020
- Aku sedang berjalan
di bawah jalan layang

3
00:00:20,498 --> 00:00:24,459
melihat para sekretaris berpakaian rapi
dan pembersih jendela yang kelelahan

4
00:00:24,502 --> 00:00:27,810
melangkah maju
untuk memulai hari mereka.

5
00:00:28,593 --> 00:00:31,683
Angin musim dingin yang dingin
menerpa wajahku,

6
00:00:31,727 --> 00:00:33,816
dan sebuah kartu menarik perhatianku.

7
00:00:34,773 --> 00:00:38,777
Aku membaliknya
dan menemukan kartu joker.

8
00:00:39,517 --> 00:00:41,563
Joker, joker.

9
00:00:43,217 --> 00:00:45,001
- [klakson mobil berbunyi]
- Ayo, ayo, jalan, jalan!

10
00:00:45,045 --> 00:00:48,135
- Segala hal dalam hidup
jarang ada yang abadi.

11
00:00:48,178 --> 00:00:49,919
Baik maupun buruk.

12
00:00:50,615 --> 00:00:52,443
<i>Jadi, jangan cemas, diriku.</i>

13
00:00:53,792 --> 00:00:56,056
<i>Aku tersenyum pada kartu</i>
<i>yang kudapat.</i>

14
00:00:56,665 --> 00:00:59,363
<i>Sama seperti salju,</i>
<i>semua itu akan mencair.</i>

15
00:01:01,365 --> 00:01:03,498
Siaran apa yang kalian dengar,
Indianapolis?

16
00:01:03,541 --> 00:01:06,457
Hari ini Selasa, 8 Februari.

17
00:01:07,371 --> 00:01:12,681
Waktu menunjukkan pukul 8:45
lewat 55 detik.

18
00:01:13,508 --> 00:01:15,162
<i>Aku DJ Fred Temple.</i>

19
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:19,557
<i>Dan ini Deodato.</i>

20
00:01:20,645 --> 00:01:24,040
[♪ Also sprach Zarathustra
oleh Deodato]

21
00:01:35,704 --> 00:01:37,488
[musik berhenti]
[erangan]

22
00:01:37,532 --> 00:01:38,794
Sialan...

23
00:01:40,752 --> 00:01:43,103
[musik menegangkan]

24
00:01:54,984 --> 00:01:56,986
[angin berdesir]

25
00:02:01,382 --> 00:02:03,949
[musik mencekam]

26
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:39,594
[bergumam]: Ah, barang sialan.

27
00:02:39,637 --> 00:02:43,337
[suasana bising resepsionis]

28
00:02:50,996 --> 00:02:52,346
Halo, Pak.

29
00:02:53,303 --> 00:02:54,435
Di mana Barb?

30
00:02:54,478 --> 00:02:56,132
Barb biasanya duduk di meja ini.
Anda orang baru?

31
00:02:56,176 --> 00:02:57,612
- Ya, aku orang baru,
terima kasih sudah bertanya.

32
00:02:57,655 --> 00:02:58,613
Aku Doreen.

33
00:02:58,656 --> 00:03:00,092
Dan Anda?

34
00:03:02,007 --> 00:03:05,576
- Um, aku Tony. Aku ada janji
dengan Meridian Mortgage.

35
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:07,099
- [Doreen]: Bagus!
- M.L. Hall.

36
00:03:07,143 --> 00:03:08,797
- M.L. Hall.
Oh, Tony...

37
00:03:09,101 --> 00:03:11,060
- Tony Kiritsis.
- Kiritsis... Kiritsis.

38
00:03:11,103 --> 00:03:13,236
- Ya.
- Kiritsis, oke.

39
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,847
Oh, Pak Hall akan menemui Anda
sebentar lagi.

40
00:03:15,891 --> 00:03:17,545
Silakan tunggu
di sofa sebelah sana.

41
00:03:22,637 --> 00:03:25,117
Di sebelah sana.
[terkekeh]

42
00:03:26,249 --> 00:03:27,555
[tertawa]
Oke.

43
00:03:37,869 --> 00:03:40,350
[telepon berdering]

44
00:03:43,745 --> 00:03:44,876
[Doreen]: Uh-huh.

45
00:03:46,182 --> 00:03:48,315
Uh-huh. Ya, ya,
dia ada di sini.

46
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,318
Uh-huh...

47
00:03:51,361 --> 00:03:52,667
Pak Kiritsis?

48
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:54,016
Aku minta maaf sekali.

49
00:03:54,059 --> 00:03:56,975
Sepertinya ada sedikit
kekacauan jadwal.

50
00:03:57,019 --> 00:04:00,457
M.L. sebenarnya
sedang di Florida sekarang.

51
00:04:00,501 --> 00:04:03,286
[suara obrolan tak jelas]

52
00:04:03,330 --> 00:04:04,374
Burrito Anda, Pak Hall.

53
00:04:06,115 --> 00:04:08,030
- Oh, oh, oh!
Bukan, bukan, bukan begini.

54
00:04:08,073 --> 00:04:09,684
Maaf, Pak?

55
00:04:09,727 --> 00:04:12,513
- Ya, kau harusnya minta maaf,
karena ini salah.

56
00:04:12,556 --> 00:04:15,472
[pelayan]: Oh, uh, pesanannya sama
seperti kemarin, Pak.

57
00:04:15,516 --> 00:04:17,996
Ayam panggang
dengan nasi dan tumis bayam.

58
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:21,609
- Tidak, tapi ini satu burrito utuh
yang dipotong dua.

59
00:04:21,652 --> 00:04:25,265
Aku selalu makan burritoku
dipotong tiga.

60
00:04:25,308 --> 00:04:28,050
Dan yang terpenting,
pada hari Selasa...

61
00:04:28,093 --> 00:04:30,052
Selasa dia tidak makan daging.

62
00:04:30,095 --> 00:04:33,055
- Aku tidak makan daging.
Tidak ada daging di hari Selasa.

63
00:04:33,098 --> 00:04:36,232
Benar sekali.
Jadi meskipun tebakanmu hampir benar...

64
00:04:37,015 --> 00:04:38,365
tetap saja salah.

65
00:04:38,408 --> 00:04:40,410
- Apa?
[Doreen]: Dia di Florida.

66
00:04:40,454 --> 00:04:43,457
Astaga, sungguh, kuharap
aku bisa ada di Florida sekarang.

67
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:46,416
- Di luar sangat dingin hari ini.
- Tidak, tidak, tidak,

68
00:04:46,460 --> 00:04:48,853
Aku ada janji dengan Meridian
Mortgage, sudah dijadwalkan.

69
00:04:48,897 --> 00:04:51,465
- Memang masih. Putranya,
Richard, sedang turun sekarang.

70
00:04:51,508 --> 00:04:52,596
[Richard]: Tony!

71
00:04:53,031 --> 00:04:54,772
Maafkan aku, aku terlambat.

72
00:04:54,816 --> 00:04:56,296
[Doreen]: Sudah kubilang padanya, Pak,
M.L.--

73
00:04:56,339 --> 00:04:57,862
- Ada perjalanan dinas mendadak.

74
00:04:57,906 --> 00:05:00,822
- Dia, dia minta maaf sekali.
- Perjalanan dinas mendadak apanya.

75
00:05:00,865 --> 00:05:02,476
Dia menghindari aku
dan musim dingin.

76
00:05:02,519 --> 00:05:05,827
- Tony, aku tahu kau dan Ayah
punya beberapa perbedaan pendapat.

77
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:07,394
Kau benar sekali.

78
00:05:07,437 --> 00:05:11,049
- Tapi bagaimana kalau kita bicarakan
dengan tenang, mengerti?

79
00:05:12,224 --> 00:05:14,401
- Apa yang terjadi padamu, Tony?
- Oh, oh.

80
00:05:14,444 --> 00:05:16,054
- Oh, ini?
- Ya.

81
00:05:16,098 --> 00:05:17,491
Bukan apa-apa.

82
00:05:17,534 --> 00:05:20,276
Aku sedang mencabut tunggul pohon
di propertiku, dan...

83
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:23,105
dan kabel sialan itu putus
lalu menyambar lenganku.

84
00:05:23,148 --> 00:05:24,411
Kau percaya itu?

85
00:05:24,454 --> 00:05:25,760
Kami turut prihatin mendengarnya.

86
00:05:25,803 --> 00:05:27,370
[Doreen]: Turut prihatin.
Pasti sakit.

87
00:05:27,414 --> 00:05:28,893
Hei, uh, dengar,

88
00:05:28,937 --> 00:05:31,592
uh, bagaimana kalau kita berdua
naik ke kantor ayahku?

89
00:05:31,635 --> 00:05:33,768
Kau tahu, ruangan yang kau suka,
yang ada meja rapatnya.

90
00:05:33,811 --> 00:05:35,596
Kedengarannya ide
yang bagus?

91
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:37,119
Kau mau?

92
00:05:38,555 --> 00:05:41,123
- Kantor M.L.?
- Ya. Ayo kita ke sana.

93
00:05:42,777 --> 00:05:44,692
- Baiklah, Dick.
Kau bosnya.

94
00:05:44,735 --> 00:05:46,215
- Kau mau permen mint?
- Tidak.

95
00:05:46,258 --> 00:05:48,348
- [lift berbunyi]
- Kita sampai.

96
00:05:48,391 --> 00:05:49,827
Maaf soal itu.

97
00:05:49,871 --> 00:05:51,568
Langsung belok
ke kiri, Tony.

98
00:05:51,612 --> 00:05:52,613
Pagi.

99
00:05:53,527 --> 00:05:55,006
Hati-hati langkahmu di sini, Tony.

100
00:05:55,050 --> 00:05:57,487
[telepon berdering]
Selamat pagi. Terima kasih.

101
00:05:57,531 --> 00:05:59,184
Apa kabar?

102
00:06:00,664 --> 00:06:04,233
Hei, Barb. Apa kabar?
Kau ingat Tony?

103
00:06:04,276 --> 00:06:06,322
- Oh, hai, Tony.
- Oh, hei, Barb.

104
00:06:06,366 --> 00:06:08,193
- Jadi di sini tempatmu sekarang.
- Ya, pindah ke atas.

105
00:06:08,237 --> 00:06:10,979
- Apa yang terjadi pada lenganmu?
- Oh, bukan apa-apa.

106
00:06:11,022 --> 00:06:13,068
- Hei, uh, Barb, apa tidak apa-apa
kalau kami pakai kantor Ayah?

107
00:06:13,111 --> 00:06:14,983
Kami cuma mau
membahas beberapa hal.

108
00:06:15,026 --> 00:06:16,985
- Senang bertemu denganmu, Barb.
Kau selalu baik padaku.

109
00:06:17,028 --> 00:06:18,639
[Richard]: Silakan masuk, Tony.

110
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:23,600
- Um... Hei, Dick, kau keberatan
kalau aku tutup pintunya?

111
00:06:23,644 --> 00:06:26,342
- Aku butuh privasi.
- Oh, ya, tentu saja.

112
00:06:26,386 --> 00:06:28,823
Celana pendekku naik terus

113
00:06:28,866 --> 00:06:30,302
sejak melewati East Market Street,

114
00:06:30,346 --> 00:06:32,130
dan aku tak mau ada yang
melihatnya.

115
00:06:32,174 --> 00:06:33,436
Kau tahu kan, ada biaya tambahannya.

116
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,785
[Richard terkekeh sopan]

117
00:06:45,970 --> 00:06:48,059
Keluarga kecil yang manis.

118
00:06:53,413 --> 00:06:54,762
Jadi, Dick, um...

119
00:06:55,415 --> 00:06:57,547
tolong bantu aku, dan, uh...

120
00:06:59,810 --> 00:07:03,379
dan buka denah
di atas meja itu.

121
00:07:03,423 --> 00:07:05,381
- Tentu saja, Tony.
Tentu.

122
00:07:06,774 --> 00:07:09,516
Jadi kurasa kau ingin membicarakan
soal lahan

123
00:07:09,559 --> 00:07:12,040
dan semua yang
kau dan Ayah

124
00:07:12,083 --> 00:07:13,476
lalui belakangan ini.

125
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:16,087
[Richard bergumam]

126
00:07:16,436 --> 00:07:17,959
[suara pelatuk senapan ditarik]

127
00:07:19,090 --> 00:07:20,483
Tunggu, tunggu sebentar.

128
00:07:21,310 --> 00:07:22,659
Sekarang, kau berbalik.

129
00:07:22,703 --> 00:07:25,445
[musik menegangkan]

130
00:07:25,488 --> 00:07:29,492
- Hei, Tony...
- Ini serius, Dick.

131
00:07:29,536 --> 00:07:31,059
Sangat serius.

132
00:07:31,102 --> 00:07:32,669
[suara bergeser]

133
00:07:32,713 --> 00:07:35,411
Aku akan mengikatkan senapan ini
ke lehermu.

134
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:41,635
- [tertawa gugup]
- Hei, tenang, Tony.

135
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:43,506
Singkirkan itu.

136
00:07:44,638 --> 00:07:47,815
Tony, kau...
Kau tidak mau melakukan ini.

137
00:07:47,858 --> 00:07:49,860
Perusahaan ini sudah berbuat salah padaku.

138
00:07:50,513 --> 00:07:52,036
Jadi aku akan memberitahu
seluruh dunia

139
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,864
apa yang kau dan ayahmu
lakukan padaku.

140
00:07:53,908 --> 00:07:55,300
Sesederhana itu.

141
00:07:57,999 --> 00:07:59,391
Apa maumu?

142
00:07:59,435 --> 00:08:01,306
- Aku ingin kau berbalik.
- Aku tidak akan--

143
00:08:01,350 --> 00:08:03,744
- Berbalik!
- Oke. Oke.

144
00:08:04,179 --> 00:08:05,615
Aku berbalik.

145
00:08:08,139 --> 00:08:09,706
Lepaskan jasmu.

146
00:08:10,228 --> 00:08:12,796
Lepaskan
bersama dengan dasimu.

147
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,494
- Tony, aku tidak--
- Mari buat dirimu nyaman.

148
00:08:15,277 --> 00:08:17,105
- Oke.
- Lepaskan.

149
00:08:17,148 --> 00:08:20,282
- Lepaskan jas sialan itu.
- Oke, oke, oke.

150
00:08:20,717 --> 00:08:21,936
Sekarang...

151
00:08:23,198 --> 00:08:24,808
Oh, ini dia.

152
00:08:26,244 --> 00:08:28,159
Lepaskan.
Nah, begitu. Oke.

153
00:08:28,203 --> 00:08:29,813
- Oke.
- Oh, ini dia.

154
00:08:29,857 --> 00:08:31,119
Sialan...

155
00:08:32,294 --> 00:08:34,949
Ini dia.
Ya.

156
00:08:34,992 --> 00:08:36,211
Tony, apa ini?

157
00:08:37,647 --> 00:08:39,257
Ini, Dick...

158
00:08:40,041 --> 00:08:41,912
adalah kawat pemicu maut.

159
00:08:42,217 --> 00:08:44,567
Kalau kau pingsan, tersandung,

160
00:08:44,611 --> 00:08:46,221
atau mencoba lari...

161
00:08:46,743 --> 00:08:48,963
Nah, begini.
Begini.

162
00:08:49,006 --> 00:08:50,617
Ini akan meledakkan kepalamu.

163
00:08:50,660 --> 00:08:54,185
- Sekarang dengar, Tony,
tidak ada yang melihat kita, oke?

164
00:08:54,229 --> 00:08:55,535
Kau sudah membuktikan maksudmu.

165
00:08:57,014 --> 00:08:59,626
Belum. Aku baru saja mulai.

166
00:09:01,584 --> 00:09:04,152
Hei!
Hei, hei, hei, hei!

167
00:09:04,195 --> 00:09:05,240
Hei, hei!

168
00:09:05,283 --> 00:09:06,937
- Tony, Tony, Tony,
mereka tak bisa lihat--

169
00:09:06,981 --> 00:09:10,027
Mereka tak bisa lihat kita, tidak lewat
jendela ayahku, oke?

170
00:09:10,071 --> 00:09:11,725
Lagipula itu tidak penting.

171
00:09:11,768 --> 00:09:13,422
Angkat telepon itu.
Angkat.

172
00:09:13,465 --> 00:09:16,294
[Fred]: Tadi itu adalah
maestro dari Polandia,

173
00:09:16,338 --> 00:09:18,732
Theo Marzynski.
[saluran telepon berdering]

174
00:09:18,775 --> 00:09:20,516
Aku DJ Fred Temple.

175
00:09:20,951 --> 00:09:23,171
WCYD.

176
00:09:25,782 --> 00:09:27,654
[saluran telepon berdering]

177
00:09:27,697 --> 00:09:29,177
[operator]: Darurat 911.

178
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:32,702
[Richard mengerang]

179
00:09:32,746 --> 00:09:35,575
- <i>[Richard]: Uh... uh...</i>
- Ya?

180
00:09:36,271 --> 00:09:38,360
<i>[Richard]: Tunggu...</i>
<i>Tunggu sebentar.</i>

181
00:09:38,403 --> 00:09:39,579
<i>[Tony]: H-H-Halo?</i>

182
00:09:40,667 --> 00:09:42,625
<i>Bu, ini hal yang sangat serius.</i>

183
00:09:43,234 --> 00:09:45,585
<i>Aku baru saja menyandera seseorang.</i>
<i>Ini bukan telepon iseng.</i>

184
00:09:45,628 --> 00:09:48,283
- Bukan, bukan, Pak.
Ada masalah apa?

185
00:09:48,326 --> 00:09:51,329
- S-Sambungkan aku dengan perwira
berpangkat tertinggi yang kalian punya.

186
00:09:51,373 --> 00:09:53,549
Ah, sialan.
Duduk, Dick.

187
00:09:53,593 --> 00:09:56,508
Kau duduk di sini pelan-pelan.
Pelan, pelan, pelan.

188
00:09:56,552 --> 00:09:57,988
<i>Seakan nyawamu bergantung padanya,</i>

189
00:09:58,032 --> 00:09:59,773
<i>karena memang begitu adanya, sobat.</i>

190
00:09:59,816 --> 00:10:03,037
- Uh...
Pak, apa masalah Anda?

191
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:07,128
- Aku sudah mengalungkan senapan
di leher seseorang. Ya.

192
00:10:07,171 --> 00:10:09,957
- <i>Biar kuberitahu sesuatu...</i>
- Chrissy, ada sandera di sini.

193
00:10:10,610 --> 00:10:12,437
- Mereka sudah mempermainkanku
selama empat tahun.

194
00:10:12,481 --> 00:10:14,091
[ketukan di pintu]
Hei... Oh!

195
00:10:14,135 --> 00:10:16,659
Suruh dia keluar dari sini.
[Barb]: Apa yang terjadi di sini?

196
00:10:17,181 --> 00:10:20,010
<i>[Richard]: Barb, tolong, tolong,</i>
<i>tolong beri kami waktu sebentar.</i>

197
00:10:20,054 --> 00:10:21,359
Semuanya baik-baik saja.

198
00:10:21,403 --> 00:10:23,187
- Ya, semuanya
baik-baik saja, Barb.

199
00:10:23,231 --> 00:10:24,580
Terima kasih, Barb.

200
00:10:25,712 --> 00:10:27,365
<i>Ya, a-aku agak kesal.</i>

201
00:10:27,409 --> 00:10:29,629
- Oke. Oke,
tenang saja.

202
00:10:29,672 --> 00:10:31,413
<i>Dengar, aku bukan orang jahat.</i>

203
00:10:31,456 --> 00:10:33,589
<i>Aku bajingan yang kejam,</i>
<i>dan aku sedang marah.</i>

204
00:10:33,633 --> 00:10:34,764
<i>Ya.</i>

205
00:10:34,808 --> 00:10:36,592
Sekarang, kalau ada yang menarikku

206
00:10:36,636 --> 00:10:38,420
atau menarik senapan ini...

207
00:10:39,334 --> 00:10:40,422
dia akan mati.

208
00:10:40,944 --> 00:10:42,206
<i>Kau mengerti?</i>

209
00:10:42,250 --> 00:10:44,165
- Anda ada di mana?
Siapa nama Anda?

210
00:10:44,208 --> 00:10:46,863
- Catat alamat lengkapnya.
Alamat lengkapnya.

211
00:10:47,821 --> 00:10:48,996
Ya. Hati-hati.

212
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:50,388
- Tolong kendurkan sedikit, Tony.

213
00:10:50,432 --> 00:10:51,563
Hati-hati.

214
00:10:51,607 --> 00:10:53,304
<i>[operator]: Siapa nama Anda?</i>

215
00:10:53,348 --> 00:10:55,176
Namaku Tony Kiritsis.

216
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:58,005
K-I-R-I-T-S-I-S.

217
00:10:58,048 --> 00:11:00,572
<i>K-I-R-I-T-S-I-S.</i>

218
00:11:00,616 --> 00:11:02,749
<i>Sekarang biar kuberitahu</i>
<i>satu hal lagi.</i>

219
00:11:02,792 --> 00:11:05,142
Aku sangat memikirkan
keluarga pria ini.

220
