00:21:30,027 --> 00:21:31,420
Siaran Duck in the Morning?

487
00:21:31,768 --> 00:21:34,510
Smooth Jazz Sundays?
Fred Temple?

488
00:21:35,990 --> 00:21:37,861
Apa kau menyetir ke tempat kerja
