492
00:21:43,998 --> 00:21:47,262
Aku cuma... aku cuma mencoba
fokus menyetir.

493
00:21:48,568 --> 00:21:50,265
Aku suka Fred Temple.

494
00:21:50,309 --> 00:21:51,875
Aku suka pendapatnya, kau tahu?

495
00:21:52,398 --> 00:21:54,313
Penyiar radio yang hebat, Tony.

496
00:21:54,356 --> 00:21:55,575
- Hati dan jiwa Indiana--

497
00:21:55,618 --> 00:21:56,837
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

498
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:58,708
[decit ban]

499
00:21:59,709 --> 00:22:01,494
Orang ini benar-benar gila.

500
00:22:04,758 --> 00:22:06,673
- Tony, tolong kendurkan
sedikit, oke?

501
00:22:06,716 --> 00:22:08,588
Aku mencoba membawa kita ke sana
dengan selamat.

502
00:22:08,631 --> 00:22:10,590
- Oh, pasukan bantuan mulai datang.

503
00:22:11,417 --> 00:22:13,984
Seluruh kota akan tahu
kalau ayahmu itu penipu besar.

504
00:22:14,463 --> 00:22:15,595
Bagaimana rasanya?

505
00:22:17,205 --> 00:22:18,728
Ayo. Terus jalan lurus.

506
00:22:18,772 --> 00:22:20,339
[Richard]: Kurasa
di depan belok kiri.

507
00:22:20,382 --> 00:22:22,253
Tadi kau bilang kiri.
Apa aku harus belok kiri?

508
00:22:22,297 --> 00:22:23,733
[Tony]: Kau pikir aku tak tahu letak
rumahku sendiri? Sialan!

509
00:22:23,777 --> 00:22:25,561
- Tutup mulut sialanmu.
- Aku cuma mencoba--

510
00:22:25,605 --> 00:22:26,867
- Belok kiri di sini,
kau benar.

511
00:22:27,520 --> 00:22:29,435
♪ Aku tahu aku akan terpuruk lagi
